    "about.milestone.2024": {en:"60+ patents and 5,000+ installations",zh:"60余项专利，5,000余台装机"},
    "about.team.lead": {en:"When you email SBKJ, your reply comes from a mechanical engineer who has personally commissioned the line you are asking about. Our sales and technical functions sit inside the same engineering department.",zh:"当您发邮件给SBKJ时，回复您的是一位亲自调试过您所咨询产线的机械工程师。我们的销售和技术职能隶属于同一个工程部门。"},
    "about.team.mech.title": {en:"Mechanical design (6 engineers)",zh:"机械设计（6名工程师）"},
